      "message": "For the next broadcast you have right but I mean case when you try to create broadcast before audio session is created.\nIf you get `EVENT_TYPE_BROADCAST_AUDIO_SESSION_CREATED` but unicast group is still active, you start monitoring it for \"Broadcast would be created once unicast group became inactive\". In this place here (LeAudioStackEvent.GROUP_STATUS_INACTIVE) you removed createBroadcast(settings); so what will create a broadcast?",
