      "writtenOn": "2024-09-05T11:08:45Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I belive this is not possible to create a broadcast before session. The flow in native is:\n1. Create broadcast is called (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster.cc;drc\u003d9f1832e49ef69135716a70701c8320ec70f4aa2e;l\u003d486)\n2. Session is created (service is informed) https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3139473/12/system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster.cc#654\n3. When state machine is created - an event with broadcast created is sent to service - https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster.cc;drc\u003d7d54e84fb0c4718bbbbcc4f4d4d47e89f8a748cb;l\u003d1003\n3.1) When there is no ISO traffic on Unicast, broadcast creation is triggered here: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster.cc;drc\u003d7d54e84fb0c4718bbbbcc4f4d4d47e89f8a748cb;l\u003d659\n3.2) or if there is Unicast traffic, https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/le_audio/broadcaster/broadcaster.cc;drc\u003d7d54e84fb0c4718bbbbcc4f4d4d47e89f8a748cb;l\u003d911\n\nIn both ways, always after Session start.",
